.TH "HOMELAB-POWER-ACTION" "1" "2026-11-06" "Homelab ops"
.SH NAME
homelab-power-action \- Perform the fixed privileged power-off action accepted by the existing SSH policy.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B homelab-power-action
[arguments]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Perform the fixed privileged power-off action accepted by the existing SSH policy.
Established names and consumer paths are preserved. No hardware or service action was executed for documentation verification.
.SH INTERFACE
.SS /usr/local/sbin/homelab-power-action
Source: shared/scripts/power-action
.nf
if sys.argv[1:]!=['off']:sys.exit('Only the fixed off action is permitted.')
.fi

.SH DEPENDENCIES
Use the interpreter in the source shebang and the existing host packages and services referenced in that source. Host configuration and private credentials remain on their original host.
.SH OPERATIONS
Before changing behavior, inspect inventory/audit-2026-11-06/qubit.json for recorded consumers and the source above for exact dependency paths. Never invoke a power, desktop, network, credential, notification, or storage operation merely to test it.
